function total() {
  let result = 0;
  for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) result += i;
  return result;
}

This function should sum every value in an array:
function sum(values) {
  let total = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < values.length - 1; i++) total += values[i];
  return total;
}
For [2,3,4], it returns 5 instead of 9. Explain the defect, a correction, one normal test and one boundary test with their expected results.

